The normative model for functional gradients is trained on HCP-D healthy controls (N=652, ages 5–21, mean 14.44±4.06), then transferred with intercept re-estimation to ABIDE TD groups (ABIDE-I and II). ABIDE TD groups are used for calibration, not training, while normative modeling analyses apply to ABIDE-I (TD and ASD) and reproducibility to ABIDE-II.
